00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:14.166
Now At the end of The Walking Dead,
our group finally found long term safety

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:16.033
at their new super group,
the Commonwealth.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.700
But Daryl Dixon didn't stick around,
he hopped on his motorcycle

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.466
and rode out to explore
the rest of the zombie apocalypse.

00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:24.400
Now Daryl's own series starts
right off with him shipwrecked and washing

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.566
ashore,
somehow he's made it all the way to

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:30.666
So Daryl's off on a French adventure,
trying to find a boat back home.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.266
But the zombies here in France, “les
affamés” ,

00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:34.566
the hungry ones, are more dangerous
than Daryl's used to,

00:00:34.566 --> 00:00:37.766
They got weird variants,
like some of them are burning hot zombies

00:00:37.766 --> 00:00:40.800
So Daryl makes some friends,
luckily everyone in France speaks English.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.800
When some bad guys show up, Daryl helps
fight them off.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.766
But his new friends
knock him out and rob him anyway.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:47.766
But Daryl’s rescued by some new friends,
yes they're nuns.

00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.800
The main
nun, Isobel, gives Daryl the tour.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.300
And yeah,
that's the cool thing about zombie

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.233
Apocalypse Europe,
You got all these castles

00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:55.666
that were designed to be self-sustaining
before electricity.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:57.933
There's a kid living here, Laurent,
who's a real gentle soul.

00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:00.166
And he and Daryl hit it off
because they both have long hair.

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:04.400
But these nuns believe Laurent is real
special: the second coming, the Messiah!

00:01:04.466 --> 00:01:06.433
Daryl is like, “Yeah, right.
Good luck with that.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.133
I'll see you later.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:07.933
Crazy nuns.”

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:09.733
The bad guys are investigating
their last patrol,

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:11.900
they're led by face
tattoo guy called Codron.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:15.500
One of the guys killed was his brother,
and this girl blames it all on Daryl.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.466
So Codron and his men storm the nunnery,
Daryl's got to help defend them.

00:01:18.466 --> 00:01:20.433
Although these nuns are far
from defenseless, oh!

00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:21.433
It's an epic killer

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:23.733
nun That's another cool
thing about France, by the way,

00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:25.533
They don't have a lot of modern guns
laying around,

00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:29.100
so they're fighting with cool
old timey guns and medieval weaponry.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.666
Now, these nuns are part of a larger
good guy group, the Union of Hope,

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.700
and they want to get Laurent up
to their base in the north.

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:36.033
And apparently there's a port nearby
with working ships.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:39.966
So, Monsieur Daryl is escorting Laurent
and Isabelle on a cross France adventure.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.566
Along the way
there's a couple of fun adventures,

00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:43.900
like this group of kids
who grew up here in their preschool.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.366
They’re
fighting an American who's taken over this

00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:47.766
castle,
and Daryl falls into his zombie moat.

00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:51.200
Then there's a conductor
who's built himself a zombie orchestra!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.800
All right, that's new.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.266
But soon they make it to the big city,
welcome to Paris.

00:01:55.266 --> 00:01:58.766
The Union of Hope has a good base
here, led by And while Laurent is probably

00:01:58.766 --> 00:02:01.833
not the real Messiah,
he is a nice kid and gives them hope.

00:02:01.966 --> 00:02:04.966
So to buy Daryl a boat ticket home,
they go to Paris's hottest

00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:06.666
underground zombie apocalypse nightclub.

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.433
The club's owner is this English
guy Quinn, who also has long hair.

00:02:09.433 --> 00:02:11.933
In fact, he looks exactly like Daryl
if he brushed it back.

00:02:11.933 --> 00:02:14.400
And turns out
Quinn is Isabelle's ex-boyfriend.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.600
Yeah, she wasn't always a nun.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.566
Before the zombie apocalypse,

00:02:16.566 --> 00:02:18.766
she was a bit of a party girl
and also a bit of a thief.

00:02:18.766 --> 00:02:20.500
There's a real cool episode
where we follow Isabel

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.433
the night the zombie apocalypse started,

00:02:22.433 --> 00:02:24.566
and as you imagine, things got bad
real quick.

00:02:24.566 --> 00:02:26.833
She and Quinn were heading out of town,
They stopped to pick up Isabelle's

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:28.100
pregnant sister, Quinn was like, “Yo,

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.266
she's slowing us down,
we got to ditch her.” But Isabel wasn't

00:02:30.266 --> 00:02:32.700
having that ditched him instead.
They ended up at the convent,

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.500
but unfortunately her
sister died in childbirth.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.033
but when her body reanimated as a zombie,
she was able to finish giving birth!

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.600
And that's Laurent,
so it was a miracle birth.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.466
But now that Quinn meets Laurent, he
reveals a secret: he is Laurent’s father!

00:02:44.566 --> 00:02:47.100
He wants Laurent and Isabel to join him
and be a happy family.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.033
But it's like, “Yo,
you cheated on me with my sister,

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:50.866
then tried to ditch her
in the zombie apocalypse.

00:02:50.866 --> 00:02:51.933
You're kind of a douche.”

00:02:51.933 --> 00:02:53.866
But there's a bigger bad guy out there,
Madam Genet,

00:02:53.866 --> 00:02:56.700
who runs the supergroup
that loosely controls all of France.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.500
She controls the port with the trans
Atlantic ships

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.500
that Daryl Dixon rode in on,
and now we finally get that story.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.800
Daryl was cruising around
America on his motorcycle.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.733
He stopped to get gas
from this French scientist

00:03:05.733 --> 00:03:08.566
who was paying fuel in exchange
for rounding up live zombies.

00:03:08.566 --> 00:03:11.633
By the way they had a radio here, so Daryl
checked in with his best friend, Carol.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.700
They had a bad connection,
but she said someone came back.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.933
Who came back?! We got to know!

00:03:16.933 --> 00:03:19.033
Daryl befriended this kid here,
but one of the other guys killed him.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.033
So Daryl picked a fight.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.433
But there's a strict
no fighting policy here, so strict

00:03:22.433 --> 00:03:26.100
in fact that if you break it, you're
loaded onto the ship to be zombie meat.

00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:28.733
But Daryl is not going out like that,
Eventually he escaped

00:03:28.733 --> 00:03:32.633
But whatever experiments they're doing on
these zombies makes them fast and strong.

00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:34.333
Daryl has got to abandon ship.

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:36.000
So yeah, it’s Genet who's really excited

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.466
about these experiments
to make zombies stronger.

00:03:38.466 --> 00:03:40.900
And she's mad at the American “Dixon”
who ruined her ship,

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.933
so she sends her goons to hunt him down.

00:03:42.933 --> 00:03:46.400
Laurent got separated, so they meet up at
the big Paris landmark, the Eiffel Tower.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.300
Unfortunately,
even in the zombie apocalypse, it's

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.600
real crowded with tourists.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.500
But now Genet has locked down the city,
they need Quinn's help to escape.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.466
So Isabelle
agrees to be his girlfriend again

00:03:54.466 --> 00:03:56.700
in exchange for getting Daryl
and Laurent out of the city.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.433
But Quinn already has a girlfriend

00:03:58.433 --> 00:04:00.766
who's none too
pleased he's swooning over his ex.

00:04:00.766 --> 00:04:03.800
So she turns him in to Genet,
and Daryl in the Laurent, are caught.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.733
So Genet learns how this whole group
thinks Laurent is the Messiah kid.

00:04:06.733 --> 00:04:08.766
So she wants to control Laurent
and have him endorse her

00:04:08.766 --> 00:04:09.866
as president of France.

00:04:09.866 --> 00:04:11.600
And indeed
tonight's her inauguration party,

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.733
where the main event is the American Daryl
Dixon in a zombie gladiator battle.

00:04:15.733 --> 00:04:16.733
But it's just one zombie,

00:04:16.733 --> 00:04:20.633
that's no big deal, except they shoot it
with the special injector dart.

00:04:20.633 --> 00:04:23.600
They supe it up with the zombie
steroids, oh!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.900
This one might be a problem.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.100
But Daryl's a pro,
he still takes this thing out.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.100
For round two
they chain him and Quinn together,

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.633
the Long Haired Duo versus
four super zombies.

00:04:31.633 --> 00:04:33.133
These zombie steroids are still a work

00:04:33.133 --> 00:04:34.966
in progress,
sometimes they don't work at all.

00:04:34.966 --> 00:04:38.600
And on this other one, it makes them
so violent it attacks another zombie.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.333
Working together, Daryl and Quinn
take the other two zombies out.

00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:44.700
Daryl's like, “Are you not entertained!?”
and chucks this zombie

00:04:44.733 --> 00:04:45.800
head right at Genet.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.466
Now the resistance causes a distraction
so Daryl can try to escape.

00:04:48.466 --> 00:04:50.100
Quinn was injured
though, he’s slowing them down.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.266
And now he wants to do right
by Isabelle and Laurent.

00:04:52.266 --> 00:04:55.900
So he has Daryl cut off his hand,
so he can separate and buy him time.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.600
But then it's awkward
when Zombie Quinn catches up to Isabelle.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.366
Daryl gives Lauren

00:04:59.366 --> 00:05:01.266
the battle
axe, “God will forgive you, kid.”

00:05:01.266 --> 00:05:04.200
As he kills his first zombie,
who is his father.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.700
And so it looks like
they're out of danger,

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.900
but danger
catches up to them, it's Codron.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.733
He wants to kill Daryl
and avenge his brother.

00:05:09.733 --> 00:05:12.500
But Genet's orders were to kill Laurent
and the nuns, too.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.866
And Cauldron is a badass, but a good guy,
So he shoots the other goons instead!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.766
“Monsieur Dixon, I will see you later.”
So our group completes the journey

00:05:20.766 --> 00:05:24.033
to the Nest, which turns out is the famous
landmark Mont St.

00:05:24.033 --> 00:05:24.633
Michelle.

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:26.833
So they're safe at the headquarters
of the Union of Hope,

00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:30.000
this multi-religious, peaceful group
led by this guy Losang.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.233
But of course Genet
is going to come for them eventually.

00:05:32.233 --> 00:05:35.433
She figured out Codron betrayed her,
So he's imprisoned, we'll see him later.

00:05:35.466 --> 00:05:39.266
So Daryl settles in for a bit, peeling
potatoes, making sexy eyes with Isabelle.

00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:41.633
Yes these two have a blossoming romance.

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:45.166
But Daryl is not sticking around,
they found him a boat back to America.

00:05:45.166 --> 00:05:47.133
But he's meeting the boat
at the Normandy Beach,

00:05:47.133 --> 00:05:50.233
where there is the cemetery
of American soldiers who died here

00:05:50.233 --> 00:05:53.666
in World War Two, including Daryl Dixon's
grandfather.

00:05:53.666 --> 00:05:56.833
It's a touching moment
as Daryl reflects on history, and how

00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.966
sometimes life takes you far from home,
but that's where you need to be.

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:02.833
So Daryl decides he can't go home yet.

00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:05.266
He's got to stay in France
and see this through.

00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:08.733
Meanwhile, back in America,
some random dude is on Daryl's bike.

00:06:08.733 --> 00:06:11.666
And he's chased down by Daryl's
best friend, Carol.

00:06:11.666 --> 00:06:14.033
she's like, “Hey, that's my friend's
bike, “where'd you get it?”

00:06:14.033 --> 00:06:16.033
But he doesn't want to talk,
he tries to rob her.

00:06:16.033 --> 00:06:19.133
So she knocks this guy out,
ties him up in the trunk, like, “Hey,

00:06:19.166 --> 00:06:22.666
let's try that again.”
So yes, Carol is coming to find Daryl!

00:06:22.766 --> 00:06:24.833
Will she make it all the way to France?

00:06:24.833 --> 00:06:28.500
And that's where The Walking Dead: Daryl
Dixon season one comes to an end.

00:06:28.733 --> 00:06:32.500
Yes season two is confirmed,
Daryl's adventure is just getting started!

